    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS have an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented owner occupied three-bedroom duplex situated in the highly sought-after Maryborough Woods development on Welwyn Road, Douglas.\r\n\r\nThis spacious and well-proportioned property offers bright, contemporary accommodation across two floors and is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous open-plan living and dining area, and a modern newly renovated, well-appointed kitchen with ample storage and workspace. Large windows provide an abundance of natural light, creating a bright and inviting living environment.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property features three well-sized bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom, along with a  family bathroom. The accommodation provides excellent flexibility for modern family living, with the additional bedrooms also suitable for home office or guest accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from its own private outdoor space with views of this mature and well-maintained surroundings of Maryborough Woods and boasts a south west facing balcony which is a sun trap and ideal for summer barbeques.\r\n\r\nLocated within easy reach of Douglas Village and Cork City, the property is ideally positioned for a wide range of amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and leisure facilities. Excellent transport links also make commuting to Cork City and surrounding areas particularly convenient.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Advised to Fully Appreciate!\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\nOwner occupied\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows Throughout\r\nWithin Walking Distance of Douglas Village\r\nDeceptively Spacious\r\nOn a Bus Route (216) to the City and Douglas\r\nTurnkey Condition\r\nLarge south west facing balcony to rear\r\nYear of Construction: 2005\r\nManagement fees in 2026 €1,050 per annum if paid on time."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nThere solid oak flooring.\n\r\n\r\nGuest WC - \r\nThere is solid oak  flooring and WC & WHB.\n\r\n\r\nLiving room - 5.4m x 3.3m \r\nThis room has solid oak flooring, a bay window overlooking the front with curtains and feature electric fire. \r\n\r\nDouble doors to - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / dining - 5.8m x 3.5m \r\nThis is a large spacious room with newly renovated modern fitted kitchen with integrated fridge freezer, electric hob and oven, integrated dishwasher and allows for the install of washing machine and dryer. Beautiful solid oak flooring.\r\n\r\nBalcony - \r\nThis large balcony just off the kitchen/diner has stone tiled flooring and room for a table and 4-6 chairs. This is a sun trap with beautiful views.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.4m x 3.1m \r\nThis large double room has carpet flooring, a bay window overlooking the front with curtains and has amble built in  wardrobes. \n\r\n\r\nEnsuite - \r\nThree-piece bathroom suite incorporating standalone Mira Sport shower unit, wash hand basin and wc. The walls and floors are tiled.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.89m x 3.34m \r\nThis large double room has carpet flooring, a window overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.29m x 2.96m \r\nThis room has carpet flooring , built in wardrobe and a window overlooking the rear. \n\r\n\r\nMain bathroom - \r\nThree-piece bathroom suite incorporating bath with electric shower, wash hand basin and wc. The floors and walls are tiled.\n\r\n\r\nBalcony - \r\nLarge area south west in aspect with lovely views.\r\n\r\n"
